# CatDex — Domain

## Entities

- **`Cat`** (`src/types/cat.ts`): id, number, name, photoUri, lat/lng, discoveredAt, views, analysis, optional `remoteId`, `sourceWorldId`
- **`CatAnalysis`**: breed, color, coat, description, suggestedName, gender, tags, confidence, rarity string, notACat, warnings, …

## Numbering & goals

- Dex number per user collection
- Goal constant `CATDEX_TARGET` / progression goal (~500) in constants/progression

## Rarity

- UI token ids: `common | uncommon | rare | exceptional` via `src/lib/catTheme.ts` (`rarityTokens`, including `glow`)
- Vision may return richer FR rarity labels — map through `resolveRevealRarity` / helpers; don’t fork palettes in chrome

## Coat themes

- Pastel coat themes in `catTheme.ts` are **card accents**, not app chrome

## Rules

- Preserve `sourceWorldId` so explorer pins disappear after capture
- Name fallbacks: `formatCatDefaultName` / suggestedName
- User corrections use `AnalysisFieldCorrection` field unions — keep training signal labeled
